# Components in markdown

Sometimes you need a boinger:

<Boinger color={colour} />

Not many people have a boinger right in their markdown.

## Markdown in markdown

Other markdown files are components too, so you can import them:

<Section />

## Markdown in components

<Seriously>

### I wasn't joking

Markdown inside a component is still *markdown*.

</Seriously>

## Svelte blocks

<ul>
{#each list as item}
	<li>{item}</li>
{/each}
</ul>
